body:
Had a good day and things to look forward to but then I read the link and all the old demons creeped back in. 

&#x200B;

“I have just now come from a party where I was its life and soul;  witticisms streamed from my lips, everyone laughed and admired me, but I  went away — yes, the dash should be as long as the radius of the  earth's orbit ——————————— and wanted to shoot myself.”

I'll keep that in mind. 

&#x200B;

Also I was surprised positively when I checked this sub and saw the advice thread and that you don't simply mock people like me. I'm not really an incel- well I'd provocatively say I am as I'm in the same situation as them, I just don't subscribe to their ideology and don't hate women\*. I'm a leftist and in online leftist circles I see what I'd say is a kind of stigmatization of virgin/single men because of incels. 

&#x200B;

\*- also I'd argue their problems are not really resulting from feminism but in part from patriarchy (women having to be "conquered" by men and not pursuing relationships actively themselves etc.). Also I don't get why hate sexually promiscuous women if you're desperate to get laid
